  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> distinct balls be distributed among <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> boxes,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>. If the probability that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;contains exactly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> balls is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> lies in the set :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>}</mo></math>",
